Project 3: Build Your Own World
Instructions: https://fa24.datastructur.es/projects/proj3/

Summary: Create an engine for generating explorable worlds
1. You’ll implement code to generate random worlds.
2. You’ll add a main menu for the user to start the game from.
3. You’ll add support for saving a game and loading it back.
4. You’ll get a chance to add any extra fun features to your project.
